c95" value="Read the audit log and blocked calls" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F0FDFA;strokeColor=#0F766E;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1290" y="656" width="236" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c96" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#0F766E;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c82" target="c95"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1388.0" y="180"/><mxPoint x="1272" y="180"/><mxPoint x="1272" y="680.0"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c97" value="Every role also does everything a guest does.
Rules that apply to every use case with the assistant:
include: Check the role and the rows.   include: Cite the source document, for a policy answer.
include: Confirm before writing, for every write.   include: Write an audit record, for every write and every personal read.
A person decides every payment slip. The assistant never decides." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#A1A1AA;dashed=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1108" width="1540" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>